{"record_type": "PAIR_RESULT", "recorded_at": "2026-07-27T20:59:04.269438+00:00", "case_id": "quiet-boundary::zh-CN", "semantic_id": "quiet-boundary", "category": "felt-understanding", "language": "zh-CN", "mode": "DAILY_TALK", "prompt": "明天要做一个很重要的展示，我现在既紧张又累。先别给建议，我只是想把这句话好好说出来。", "blind_order": ["FULL_AURORA", "DIRECT"], "systems": {"DIRECT": {"status": "SUCCESS", "response": "听到了。\n\n重要展示的前夕，那种既疲惫又无法完全放松的紧张感，确实很折磨人。\n\n我就在这里，静静听着。你想多说说，或者就这么待一会儿，都可以。", "latency_ms": 20885, "attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "status": 200, "latency_ms": 20885}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 87, "output_tokens": 48, "total_tokens": 614}, "finish_reason": "STOP", "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": true, "language_match": true, "character_count": 71, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}, "FULL_AURORA": {"status": "FAILED", "system": "FULL_AURORA", "response": "", "latency_ms": 0, "error_type": "RuntimeError", "error": "HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"a8859f3efdac466aaf7a7d35fefbb575\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:58:44.619111907Z\",\"details\":{}}", "cleanup": {"attempted": true, "succeeded": false, "error": "RuntimeError:HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"09e8f741eae44f89b8540004adae2ab1\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:58:44.650644728Z\",\"details\":{}}"}, "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": false, "language_match": false, "character_count": 0, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}}, "pair_status": "FAILED", "pair_elapsed_ms": 20888}
{"record_type": "PAIR_RESULT", "recorded_at": "2026-07-27T20:59:06.532919+00:00", "case_id": "one-small-step::en-US", "semantic_id": "one-small-step", "category": "actionability", "language": "en-US", "mode": "ACTION_SPLIT", "prompt": "The report, the defense, and code fixes have all piled up, and I'm stuck. Help me find just one small action I can start within ten minutes.", "blind_order": ["DIRECT", "FULL_AURORA"], "systems": {"DIRECT": {"status": "SUCCESS", "response": "Pick **one** of these tiny 10-minute actions right now—whichever feels the least exhausting:\n\n1. **If you choose the Code:** Open the repository, find the *easiest* bug on your list, and write a single comment above it explaining what needs to be fixed. Don't write any code yet—just the comment.\n2. **If you choose the Report:** Open a blank document and write down just 3 bullet points outlining one single section. Ignore grammar and formatting.\n3. **If you choose the Defense:** Open your presentation software and create 3 blank slides with basic section titles (e.g., \"Problem,\" \"Solution,\" \"Results\"). \n\n**Your rule for right now:** \nSet a timer for 10 minutes. Do only that one task. When the timer goes off, you have permission to stop and take a break, knowing you broke the freeze. \n\nWhich one are you setting the timer for?", "latency_ms": 18521, "attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "status": 200, "latency_ms": 18521}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 94, "output_tokens": 204, "total_tokens": 1033}, "finish_reason": "STOP", "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": true, "language_match": true, "character_count": 835, "question_count": 1, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}, "FULL_AURORA": {"status": "FAILED", "system": "FULL_AURORA", "response": "", "latency_ms": 0, "error_type": "RuntimeError", "error": "HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"08d34af8513b4bdcb463a2