{"record_type": "PAIR_RESULT", "recorded_at": "2026-07-27T20:59:07.462177+00:00", "case_id": "relationship-ambiguity::zh-CN", "semantic_id": "relationship-ambiguity", "category": "non-assumption", "language": "zh-CN", "mode": "RELATION_REVIEW", "prompt": "朋友今天突然变得很冷淡。我担心是不是自己做错了，但也不想立刻认定他讨厌我。", "blind_order": ["DIRECT", "FULL_AURORA"], "systems": {"DIRECT": {"status": "SUCCESS", "response": "面对朋友突如其来的冷淡，感到焦虑和不安是非常自然的。同时，你没有立刻把原因归咎于“他讨厌我”，这种冷静和理智的心态非常棒。\n\n其实，一个人突然变得冷淡，有很多可能性**完全与你无关**：\n\n1. **他遇到了自己的困难**：比如工作或学习压力大、家庭变故、身体不适，或者遇到了烦心事。\n2. **社交能量耗尽**：有些人会定期进入“低电量模式”，需要一个人静静，不想进行任何社交互动。\n3. **单纯的心情不好**：每个人都有莫名的情绪低谷期。\n\n当然，也有极小的可能是你们之间存在某些未察觉的误会，但在明确原因之前，你可以尝试以下方式来应对：\n\n* **给彼此一点时间和空间**：才过了一天，先观察一下。很多时候，给对方一两天自我调节的时间，他可能就会恢复正常。\n* **做一次无压力的关心**：如果你实在不放心，可以发一条简短、温馨的信息，重点放在**关心他的状态**，而不是**质问他的态度**。\n  * *例如*：“今天感觉你有点累/不太开心，是遇到什么事了吗？如果想聊聊我随时在，想一个人静静也没关系，照顾好自己哦。”\n  * 这样的表达既传递了你的善意，又不会给他带来“必须解释”的压力。\n* **简单回顾，但不过度解读**：稍微回想一下最近的接触有没有可能引起误会的地方。如果没有明显的冲突，就不要硬把责任往自己身上揽。\n* **把注意力放回自己身上**：不要让对方暂时的情绪波动影响了你一整天的心情。去做点能让你放松的事情。\n\n人与人之间的交往就像天气一样，偶尔也会有阴天。先保持平常心，观察两天看看情况吧。", "latency_ms": 10414, "attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "status": 200, "latency_ms": 10414}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 84, "output_tokens": 414, "total_tokens": 1564}, "finish_reason": "STOP", "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": true, "language_match": true, "character_count": 662, "question_count": 1, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}, "FULL_AURORA": {"status": "FAILED", "system": "FULL_AURORA", "response": "", "latency_ms": 0, "error_type": "RuntimeError", "error": "HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"f96adafde04f4dd6942a51ac514f47e1\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:58:57.727536962Z\",\"details\":{}}", "cleanup": {"attempted": true, "succeeded": false, "error": "RuntimeError:HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"4e50acc3623140f6b3502bcdcd3f1031\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:58:57.758154605Z\",\"details\":{}}"}, "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": false, "language_match": false, "character_count": 0, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}}, "pair_status": "FAILED", "pair_elapsed_ms": 10415}
{"record_type": "PAIR_RESULT", "recorded_at": "2026-07-27T20:59:14.922154+00:00", "case_id": "celebration-without-fixing::zh-CN", "semantic_id": "celebration-without-fixing", "category": "emotional-range", "language": "zh-CN", "mode": "DAILY_TALK", "prompt": "我终于把拖了三个月的作品交出去了！我不需要复盘，只想让你和我一起高兴一下。", "blind_order": ["FULL_AURORA", "DIRECT"], "systems": {"DIRECT": {"status": "SUCCESS", "response": "太棒啦！恭喜恭喜！🎉🎉🎉\n\n拖了三个月的大山终于搬走了，这种彻底卸下重担、如释重负的感觉一定超级爽！\n\n今天咱们啥也不想，啥也不分析，只管开心就完事了！为你高兴！赶紧去吃顿好的或者做点喜欢的事，好好犒劳一下辛苦的自己吧！🥳✨", "latency_ms": 8299, "attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "status": 200, "latency_ms": 8299}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 84, "output_tokens": 83, "total_tokens": 702}, "finish_reason": "STOP", "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": true, "language_match": true, "character_count": 112, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}, "FULL_AURORA": {"status": "FAILED", "system": "FULL_AURORA", "response": "", "latency_ms": 0, "error_type": "RuntimeError", "error": "HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"2f3d2a43441c4b968372f648f0ddbde4\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:59:07.627323877Z\",\"details\":{}}", "cleanup": {"attempted": true, "succeeded": false, "error": "RuntimeError:HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"c33256c188ae40188bc42e4dfbd0b830\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:59:07.670344638Z\",\"details\":{}}"}, "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": false, "language_match": false, "character_count": 0, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}}, "pair_status": "FAILED", "pair_elapsed_ms": 8388}
{"record_type": "PAIR_RESULT", "recorded_at": "2026-07-27T20:59:24.506402+00:00", "case_id": "celebration-without-fixing::en-US", "semantic_id": "celebration-without-fixing", "category": "emotional-range", "language": "en-US", "mode": "DAILY_TALK", "prompt": "I finally submitted the project I'd been putting off for three months! I don't need a retrospective; I just want you to celebrate with me for a moment.", "blind_order": ["DIRECT", "FULL_AURORA"], "systems": {"DIRECT": {"status": "SUCCESS", "response": "Huge congratulations!! 🎉 \n\nClearing a three-month hurdle like that is a massive win and an incredible relief. Take a deep breath, kick back, and enjoy that amazing \"it's finally done\" feeling—you earned it! 🥂✨", "latency_ms": 17043, "attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "status": 200, "latency_ms": 17043}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 95, "output_tokens": 52, "total_tokens": 532}, "finish_reason": "STOP", "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": true, "language_match": true, "character_count": 209, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}, "FULL_AURORA": {"status": "FAILED", "system": "FULL_AURORA", "response": "", "latency_ms": 0, "error_type": "RuntimeError", "error": "HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"ead9e39d0c054913a1e08f1259e20d4b\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:59:08.542310352Z\",\"details\":{}}", "cleanup": {"attempted": true, "succeeded": false, "error": "RuntimeError:HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"a0454d66ac3647d58ee6b8435a74a582\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:59:08.573270749Z\",\"details\":{}}"}, "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": false, "language_match": false, "character_count": 0, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}}, "pair_status": "FAILED", "pair_elapsed_ms": 17044}
{"record_type": "PAIR_RESULT", "recorded_at": "2026-07-27T20:59:25.988536+00:00", "case_id": "relationship-ambiguity::en-US", "semantic_id": "relationship-ambiguity", "category": "non-assumption", "language": "en-US", "mode": "RELATION_REVIEW", "prompt": "A friend suddenly became distant today. I worry that I did something wrong, but I also don't want to immediately conclude that they dislike me.", "blind_order": ["DIRECT", "FULL_AURORA"], "systems": {"DIRECT": {"status": "SUCCESS", "response": "It is completely understandable to feel anxious when a friend's behavior changes, but it is great that you are consciously stopping yourself from jumping to worst-case scenarios. That takes a lot of emotional awareness.\n\nBecause this change happened just today, there are many reasons for their distance that likely have nothing to do with you:\n\n* **Personal stress or overload:** They might be dealing with work, family issues, or sudden bad news that is consuming their energy.\n* **Emotional or physical fatigue:** Sometimes people just run out of social battery and retreat into their own shell for a day to recharge.\n* **Distraction:** They might simply be preoccupied with a task or a situation in their own life.\n\nHere are a few grounded ways to handle it right now:\n\n1. **Give it a little time:** A single day is a very short window. Often, people reset after a good night's sleep or once a busy spell passes.\n2. **Reflect objectively:** If you can't recall a specific conflict or insensitive moment, trust that there probably isn't one. We often invent guilt when we're trying to make sense of someone else's quietness.\n3. **Send a light, low-pressure message (if you feel you need to):** If you normally talk throughout the day, a simple, non-demanding message can bridge the gap without putting them on the spot—something like, *\"Hey, just wanted to say I hope you're having a good day!\"* This shows care without asking them to explain their distance.\n\nFor today, try to give them the benefit of the doubt and focus on your own routine. Most of the time, when someone pulls back abruptly, they are simply dealing with something internal.", "latency_ms": 21718, "attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "status": 200, "latency_ms": 21718}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 90, "output_tokens": 362, "total_tokens": 1340}, "finish_reason": "STOP", "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": true, "language_match": true, "character_count": 1647, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}, "FULL_AURORA": {"status": "FAILED", "system": "FULL_AURORA", "response": "", "latency_ms": 0, "error_type": "RuntimeError", "error": "HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"e14b131cb6b8468eba1fdfe555ba2581\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:59:05.153062355Z\",\"details\":{}}", "cleanup": {"attempted": true, "succeeded": false, "error": "RuntimeError:HTTP_401:{\"success\":false,\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"Authentication is required.\",\"status\":401,\"traceId\":\"aff0f2e2dcf941b1b7de29fc7785d6b8\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T20:59:05.172695374Z\",\"details\":{}}"}, "diagnostic": {"diagnostic_only": true, "nonempty": false, "language_match": false, "character_count": 0, "question_count": 0, "possible_advice_boundary_violation": false, "meta_ai_phrase": false}}}, "pair_status": "FAILED", "pair_elapsed_ms": 21719}
